  <div class="container narrow prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Sherubtsean Suggest stores the name, email, role, and account activity needed to run a campus suggestion platform.</p>
    <p>Passwords are hashed and are never stored in plain text. Suggestions marked anonymous hide your name from other students and tutors, but administrators can still manage the record.</p>
    <p>Session cookies keep you logged in. Do not share your account. Contact an administrator if you believe your account was used without permission.</p>
  </div>
</section>

